# 2025中考英语
# 领域: K12基础教育
# 学科: 英语
# 来源: 2025中考英语
{{知识点1}}{{一般现在时：表示经常性、习惯性的动作或客观事实。结构：主语+动词原形/三单形式(s/es)。标志词：always, usually, often, sometimes, every day。例：He goes to school by bus every day. She doesn't like coffee.}}
{{知识点2}}{{一般过去时：表示过去发生的动作或存在的状态。结构：主语+动词过去式(ed/不规则)。标志词：yesterday, last week, in 2020, ago, just now。例：I visited my grandparents last Sunday. Did you finish your homework?}}
{{知识点3}}{{一般将来时：表示将要发生的动作或计划。两种结构：①will+动词原形（临时决定/预测）②be going to+动词原形（计划/有迹象）。标志词：tomorrow, next week, in the future。例：It will rain tomorrow. I am going to study abroad.}}
{{知识点4}}{{现在进行时：表示正在进行的动作。结构：主语+be(am/is/are)+doing。标志词：now, look, listen, at the moment。例：Look! The children are playing football. 注意：部分动词不用于进行时（know, like, want等状态动词）。}}
{{知识点5}}{{现在完成时：表示过去发生的动作对现在有影响，或从过去持续到现在。结构：主语+have/has+过去分词。标志词：already, yet, just, ever, never, since, for, so far。例：I have already finished my homework. He has lived here since 2018.}}
{{知识点6}}{{被动语态：表示主语是动作的承受者。结构：主语+be+过去分词(+by+执行者)。常考时态：一般现在时done、一般过去时was/were done、一般将来时will be done、含情态动词can/must/should be done。例：The bridge was built in 2010. English is spoken all over the world.}}
{{知识点7}}{{宾语从句三要素：①引导词(that/whether/if/wh-疑问词)②陈述语序③时态一致。例：He asked me where I lived. I don't know if/whether he will come. 注意：主句为一般过去时，从句一般用过去的某种时态（客观真理除外）。}}
{{知识点8}}{{定语从句：修饰名词或代词的从句。关系代词：who(人作主语/宾语)、whom(人作宾语)、whose(所属)、which(物)、that(人/物)。例：The boy who is standing there is my brother. This is the book that I bought yesterday. 只能用that的情况：先行词被最高级/序数词/不定代词修饰时。}}
{{知识点9}}{{状语从句常考类型：①时间状语从句(when, while, before, after, until, as soon as)②条件状语从句(if, unless)③原因状语从句(because, since)④结果状语从句(so...that, such...that)。主将从现原则：if/when引导的从句用一般现在时表将来。例：If it rains tomorrow, we will stay at home.}}
{{知识点10}}{{名词的数：可数名词复数变化规则：①一般加-s②以s/x/ch/sh结尾加-es③辅音+y结尾变y为i加-es④以f/fe结尾变f为v加-es。不规则复数：man-men, woman-women, child-children, foot-feet, tooth-teeth, mouse-mice, sheep-sheep, fish-fish, deer-deer。}}
{{知识点11}}{{代词分类及用法：①人称代词(I/me, he/him等)②物主代词(my/mine, his/his等)③反身代词(myself, yourself等)④不定代词(some/any, each/every, both/all/neither/either, another/other/the other)。易错点：it的用法——指代前文、天气、时间、距离、形式主语/宾语。}}
{{知识点12}}{{形容词和副词的比较级与最高级：①规则变化：单音节加-er/-est；以e结尾加-r/-st；辅元辅双写加-er/-est；多音节前加more/most②不规则：good/well-better-best, bad/badly-worse-worst, many/much-more-most, little-less-least, far-farther/further-farthest/furthest。句型：A is taller than B. A is the tallest in/of...}}
{{知识点13}}{{介词常考搭配：①时间介词：in(月/年/季节/上午下午晚上), on(具体某天/星期), at(时刻/节日期间)②地点介词：in(里面), on(上面), at(小地点), above/over/below/under③方式介词：by(乘坐/通过), with(用/和), in(用语言/颜色)。固定搭配：be good at, be interested in, be proud of, look forward to, depend on。}}
{{知识点14}}{{情态动词用法：①can/could(能力/许可/可能性)②may/might(许可/可能)③must(必须)/mustn't(禁止)④should/ought to(应该)⑤need(需要)/needn't(不必)⑥had better(最好)。注意：must开头的否定回答用needn't/don't have to。can't表示否定推测"不可能"，must表示肯定推测"一定是"。}}
{{知识点15}}{{非谓语动词：①动词不定式(to do)：作主语、宾语、定语、状语、补语。常接不定式的动词：want, decide, hope, wish, plan, agree, refuse, learn, afford②动名词(doing)：常接doing的动词：enjoy, finish, mind, practice, keep, suggest, consider, avoid, give up, feel like③省to不定式：使役动词make/let/have sb do sth，感官动词see/hear/watch sb do sth。}}
{{知识点16}}{{连词分类：①并列连词：and, but, or, so, both...and, either...or, neither...nor, not only...but also②从属连词：because, although/though, if, when, while, until, unless, as soon as, so...that。易错：although不能和but连用；because不能和so连用。}}
{{知识点17}}{{There be句型：表示"某地有某物"。结构：There is/are+主语+地点。就近原则：There is a book and two pens on the desk. 否定：There isn't... 疑问：Is there...? 与have/has的区别：There be强调"存在"，have/has强调"拥有"。}}
{{知识点18}}{{感叹句：What引导（修饰名词）：What a/an+形容词+可数名词单数+主谓! What+形容词+不可数名词/可数名词复数+主谓! How引导（修饰形容词/副词）：How+形容词/副词+主谓! 例：What a beautiful flower it is! / How beautiful the flower is!}}
{{知识点19}}{{祈使句：以动词原形开头，省略主语you。肯定：Open the door. / Be quiet. 否定：Don't open the door. / Don't be late. Let型：Let's go. 否定：Let's not go. 反意疑问部分用will you(Let's用shall we)。}}
{{知识点20}}{{反意疑问句：前肯后否，前否后肯。含否定词(hardly, never, few, little, nothing, nobody, neither, no)的句子视为否定句。特殊用法：①I am..., aren't I?②Let's..., shall we?③祈使句..., will you?④There be..., be there?⑤主句有think/believe/suppose且主语为第一人称时，疑问部分与从句一致。}}
{{知识点21}}{{中考必背高频词汇辨析①：spend/cost/take/pay区别——sb spend time/money on sth/(in) doing sth; sth cost sb money; It takes sb time to do sth; sb pay money for sth。例：I spent 2 hours on my homework. The book cost me 30 yuan. It took me 20 minutes to get there.}}
{{知识点22}}{{中考必背高频词汇辨析②：borrow/lend/keep——borrow...from(借入), lend...to(借出), keep(借多久，可与时间段连用)。例：Can I borrow your pen? Could you lend me your book? You can keep it for two weeks.}}
{{知识点23}}{{中考必背高频词汇辨析③：see/watch/look/read——see(看见，强调结果), watch(观看，持续性), look(看，不及物，加at), read(阅读)。例：I saw him crossing the road. We watched TV last night. Look at the blackboard. I like reading books.}}
{{知识点24}}{{中考必背高频词汇辨析④：say/speak/talk/tell——say+说话内容, speak+语言/正式发言, talk with/to sb about sth(交谈), tell sb sth/tell sb to do sth(告诉)。例：He said he was tired. Can you speak English? We talked about the movie.}}
{{知识点25}}{{中考必背高频词汇辨析⑤：look for/find/find out——look for(寻找，强调过程), find(找到，强调结果), find out(查明，通过调查/研究)。例：I'm looking for my keys. I found my keys under the desk. Please find out when the train leaves.}}
{{知识点26}}{{中考必背高频词汇辨析⑥：other/another/the other/others/the others——other+名词复数(其他的), another+单数(另一个), the other(两者中的另一个), others=other+名词(另一些), the others(其余全部)。one...the other(一个...另一个), some...others(一些...另一些)。}}
{{知识点27}}{{中考必背高频词汇辨析⑦：few/a few/little/a little——few+可数名词复数(几乎没有，否定), a few+可数名词复数(一些，肯定), little+不可数名词(几乎没有，否定), a little+不可数名词(一点，肯定)。例：There are few students in the classroom. I have a little money.}}
{{知识点28}}{{中考必背高频词汇辨析⑧：already/yet/still——already用于肯定句(已经)，yet用于否定句和疑问句(还/已经)，still(仍然)。例：I have already finished. Have you finished yet? He is still working. 位置：already和still通常放在行为动词前、be动词/助动词后。}}
{{知识点29}}{{完形填空解题技巧：①通读全文，把握主旨②瞻前顾后，逻辑推理③利用上下文语境选词④注意固定搭配和词义辨析⑤先易后难，逐步推进⑥回读检查，确保连贯。重点关注：动词、名词、形容词、连词、介词的用法。}}
{{知识点30}}{{阅读理解解题策略：①细节理解题：定位原文，同义转换②主旨大意题：关注首尾段和各段首句③推理判断题：依据原文合理推断，不主观臆断④词义猜测题：利用上下文、构词法、同义/反义线索。技巧：先看题目再读文章，带着问题找答案。}}
{{知识点31}}{{书面表达万能句型①开头：I'm writing to tell you about... / I'd like to share my opinion about... / As we all know, ... / With the development of..., ...②过渡：What's more, ... / Besides, ... / In addition, ... / However, ... / On the other hand, ...③结尾：In a word, ... / All in all, ... / I hope... / I believe...}}
{{知识点32}}{{书面表达高分技巧：①审题：确定体裁、人称、时态、要点②结构：三段式（开头引题+正文展开+结尾总结）③语言：使用高级词汇和句型，避免中式英语④连贯：使用过渡词使文章流畅⑤检查：拼写、语法、标点。亮点句型：强调句、感叹句、with复合结构、非谓语动词。}}
{{知识点33}}{{交际用语——问路与指路：Excuse me, could you tell me the way to...? / How can I get to...? / Go straight and turn left/right at the first crossing. / It's on your left/right. / It's about 10 minutes' walk. 回答方向时注意：Go along/down the street, take the second turning on the right.}}
{{知识点34}}{{交际用语——打电话与看病：打电话：May/Could I speak to...? / This is... speaking. / Hold on, please. / Sorry, he isn't in. / Can I take a message? 看病：What's the matter/wrong with you? / I have a headache/cold/fever. / You should take some medicine and have a good rest.}}
{{知识点35}}{{交际用语——邀请与建议：邀请：Would you like to...? / Why not...? / Why don't you...? / Let's... / Shall we...? 接受：Yes, I'd love/like to. / That sounds great. / Sure, why not? 拒绝：I'd love to, but... / I'm afraid I can't. / Sorry, I have to...}}
{{知识点36}}{{中考常考不规则动词表（部分）：be-was/were-been, become-became-become, begin-began-begun, break-broke-broken, bring-brought-brought, build-built-built, buy-bought-bought, catch-caught-caught, choose-chose-chosen, come-came-come, do-did-done, draw-drew-drawn, drink-drank-drunk, drive-drove-driven, eat-ate-eaten, fall-fell-fallen, feel-felt-feelt, find-found-found, fly-flew-flown, forget-forgot-forgotten, get-got-gotten, give-gave-given, go-went-gone, grow-grew-grown, have-had-had, hear-heard-heard, hide-hid-hidden, hold-held-held, keep-kept-kept, know-knew-known, lay-laid-laid, lead-led-led, learn-learned/learnt-learned/learnt, leave-left-left, lend-lent-lent, let-let-let, lie-lay-lain, lose-lost-lost, make-made-made, mean-meant-meant, meet-met-met, pay-paid-paid, put-put-put, read-read-read, ride-rode-ridden, ring-rang-rung, rise-rose-risen, run-ran-run, say-said-said, see-saw-seen, sell-sold-sold, send-sent-sent, set-set-set, shake-shook-shaken, show-showed-shown, shut-shut-shut, sing-sang-sung, sit-sat-sat, sleep-slept-slept, speak-spoke-spoken, spend-spent-spent, stand-stood-stood, swim-swam-swum, take-took-taken, teach-taught-taught, tell-told-told, think-thought-thought, throw-threw-thrown, understand-understood-understood, wake-woke-woken, wear-wore-worn, win-won-won, write-wrote-written。}}
{{知识点37}}{{中考重点句型转换：①同义句转换：so...that→too...to/enough to; not...until→...when; be good at→do well in; why not→why don't you; be able to→can; have to→must②主动变被动：找出宾语作主语，动词变be+过去分词③直接引语变间接引语：人称、时态、指示代词、时间地点状语相应变化。}}
{{知识点38}}{{阅读理解常见体裁及特点：①记叙文：关注时间、地点、人物、事件、原因、结果(5W1H)②说明文：关注说明对象、特征、方法(举例、比较、数字等)③议论文：关注论点、论据、论证方法④应用文(广告、通知、书信等)：关注关键信息(时间、地点、价格、条件)。}}
{{知识点39}}{{书面表达常见话题范文框架①——环保类：开头：Nowadays, environmental problems are becoming more and more serious. 正文：We should... / We'd better... / It's important for us to... 具体措施：save water/electricity, plant more trees, reduce pollution, use public transport, recycle waste. 结尾：Let's take action to protect our environment. Only in this way can we have a better future.}}
{{知识点40}}{{书面表达常见话题范文框架②——校园生活类：开头：I'd like to tell you about my school life. 正文：介绍课程(I have...classes every day, my favorite subject is...), 课外活动(after-school activities, join clubs), 师生关系(teachers are kind and patient), 感受(I enjoy.../I feel lucky to...). 结尾：I love my school life and I will try my best to...}}
{{知识点41}}{{书面表达常见话题范文框架③——科技与网络类：开头：With the development of technology, the Internet has become an important part of our life. 正文：优点：get information quickly, communicate with friends, learn online, make life more convenient. 缺点：spend too much time, be bad for eyes, some information is not true. 结尾：We should use the Internet wisely and make good use of it.}}
{{知识点42}}{{书面表达常见话题范文框架④——传统文化类：开头：China has a long history and rich culture. 正文：举例说明(traditional festivals, Chinese food, art forms like paper cutting/Beijing Opera, the Spring Festival/Mid-Autumn Festival). 表达看法：I think we should learn about and spread Chinese culture. 结尾：Chinese culture is a treasure of the world. Let's work together to protect and develop it.}}
{{知识点43}}{{书面表达常见话题范文框架⑤——健康与安全类：开头：Health is very important to everyone. 正文：如何保持健康：eat healthy food, do exercise regularly, have enough sleep, keep a good mood, stay away from junk food/smoking/drinking. 安全建议：obey traffic rules, be careful with fire/electricity, don't swim alone. 结尾：Let's develop healthy habits and stay safe.}}
{{知识点44}}{{听力应试技巧：①听前：快速浏览题目和选项，预测内容②听中：抓住关键词，注意数字、时间、地点、人物等信息③听后：立即作答，不确定的先选一个④注意转折词(but, however, actually)后的内容往往是答案⑤短对话重点听第二个人的回答⑥长对话/独白注意开头和结尾，把握整体脉络。}}
{{知识点45}}{{中考英语易错语法点汇总：①主谓一致：就近原则(either...or, neither...nor, not only...but also)和就远原则(as well as, together with, with, except, besides)②时态混用：since+过去时间点用现在完成时，for+时间段用现在完成时③冠词：a/an+辅音/元音音素开头(不是字母)，the+特指/独一无二④名词所有格：'s所有格和of所有格的用法区别⑤比较级前可用much/a lot/even/still/far修饰，但不能用very。}}
{{知识点46}}{{书面表达常见话题范文框架⑥——人物介绍类：开头：I'd like to introduce... to you. / My hero is... 正文：基本信息(name, age, appearance, personality), 主要事迹(what he/she did, why he/she is great), 对我的影响(inspired me to...). 结尾：He/She is not only... but also... I will learn from him/her and try my best to...}}
{{知识点47}}{{构词法知识：①合成词：classroom, homework, basketball, newspaper, everything②派生词前缀：un-(unhappy), dis-(disagree), re-(rewrite), mis-(mistake), im-(impossible), inter-(international)③派生词后缀：-ful(careful), -less(careless), -ly(quickly), -tion(education), -ment(development), -ness(kindness), -er/-or(teacher, visitor), -able(comfortable), -ive(active), -y(rainy, cloudy)。}}
{{知识点48}}{{书面表达常见话题范文框架⑦——书信/邮件格式：称呼Dear..., 正文第一段说明写信目的(I'm writing to...), 第二段展开内容(First...Second...What's more...), 第三段结尾(I'm looking forward to your reply. / I hope to hear from you soon.), 落款Yours sincerely/Love, +署名。注意书信语气礼貌得体，适当使用please, would, could等。}}
{{知识点49}}{{主谓一致核心规则：①不可数名词/动名词/不定式作主语用单数②each/every+名词用单数③both...and用复数④就远原则：A as well as B用单数(与A一致)⑤the number of+复数名词用单数(…的数目), a number of+复数名词用复数(许多)⑥family/class/team等集体名词看语境：强调整体用单数，强调成员用复数。}}
{{知识点50}}{{中考英语作文万能高级表达替换：①very→extremely/quite/terribly②think→consider/believe③important→significant/essential④because of→due to/owing to⑤more and more→an increasing number of⑥good→excellent/wonderful⑦bad→terrible/awful⑧like→be fond of/be keen on⑨want to→would like to/look forward to⑩can→be able to/be capable of。使用高级词汇可提升作文档次，但确保拼写正确。}}
